      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "               PLAIN              POLITE\nDICT:      taberu (eat)        tabemasu\nNEGATIVE:  tabe-nai (not eat)    tabemasen\nPAST:      tabe-ta (ate)         tabemashita\nPAST NEG:  tabe-nakatta          tabemasen deshita\nTE-FORM:   tabe-te (connect)     -  (tabete kudasai = please eat)\n\nTE-form is the super-connector: tabete, nonde, itte = and then...",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "               PLAIN              POLITE\nDICT:      taberu (eat)        tabemasu\nNEGATIVE:  tabe-nai (not eat)    tabemasen\nPAST:      tabe-ta (ate)         tabemashita\nPAST NEG:  tabe-nakatta          tabemasen deshita\nTE-FORM:   tabe-te (connect)     -  (tabete kudasai = please eat)\n\nTE-form is the super-connector: tabete, nonde, itte = and then...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
