      "text": "kirei (na) (pretty)\nNeeds da/desu\n\nkirei da (is pretty)\nkirei janai (not pretty)\nkirei datta (was pretty)\nkirei de (pretty and...)\n\nActs like NOUN + da\nUse na when before noun: kirei NA hana",
      "fontSize": 15,
