      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1992235568,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1321193731,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VISUAL SUMMARY:\n\n[JAPANESE GRAMMAR IS LEGO]\nEach [Noun+Particle] block snaps anywhere before the final Verb brick. Verb brick holds all the grammar: past/present, negative/positive, polite/plain, question.\nParticles are color-coded connectors: wa=topic spotlight, ga=doer spotlight, o=target, ni=destination/time, de=tool/place-of-action, no=glue.\nConjugation is just swapping the tail: taberu -> tabe-nai -> tabe-ta -> tabe-masu -> tabe-mashita.\nPoliteness is vertical: plain at bottom, polite in middle, keigo at top. Same meaning, different altitude.\n\nStart simple: Watashi wa sushi ga suki desu. (As for me, sushi is likeable = I like sushi) -> Then add blocks!",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VISUAL SUMMARY:\n\n[JAPANESE GRAMMAR IS LEGO]\nEach [Noun+Particle] block snaps anywhere before the final Verb brick. Verb brick holds all the grammar: past/present, negative/positive, polite/plain, question.\nParticles are color-coded connectors: wa=topic spotlight, ga=doer spotlight, o=target, ni=destination/time, de=tool/place-of-action, no=glue.\nConjugation is just swapping the tail: taberu -> tabe-nai -> tabe-ta -> tabe-masu -> tabe-mashita.\nPoliteness is vertical: plain at bottom, polite in middle, keigo at top. Same meaning, different altitude.\n\nStart simple: Watashi wa sushi ga suki desu. (As for me, sushi is likeable = I like sushi) -> Then add blocks!",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
